    "name": "Frozen Margarita",
    "instructions": "1. Prepare the glass, if using the lime-salt rim. Moisten half the rim of a double rocks glass with a lime wheel, then dip gently in kosher salt.\n2. Combine all ingredients in a blender.\n3. Fill a 13-ounce double rocks glass with a heaping scoop of pebble ice (see Editor’s Note).\n4. Add ice to the blender and blend until smooth.\n5. Pour into a double rocks glass.",
